{
  "id": "lem-sfb-coefficient-map-comp",
  "kind": "statement",
  "title": "The coefficient change of a composite",
  "statement": "For morphisms $a\\colon\\Lambda\\to\\Lambda'$ and $b\\colon\\Lambda'\\to\\Lambda''$ of condensed\nabelian groups (in particular of condensed rings) and every scheme $X$, the coefficient changes\nof [def-sfb-coefficient-map] satisfy $(b\\circ a)_X=b_X\\circ a_X$.",
  "source": {
    "document": "literature/blueprint/main-20261015/blueprint/sec-six-functors-basics/sk-def-sfb-coefficient-change/lem-sfb-coefficient-map-comp.md",
